# v12-merlin (Merlin V-1650-9 [V12] (NA)): written by tools/fit --upstream-scenarios from the engine dump.
# The engine stalls at speed control 0 (0 rpm in the dump), so idle is the fallback 600 rpm.
# Simulation-rate check: a 3 s full-throttle hold, rendered at the
# simulation frequency of the engine (7000 Hz).
hold 2000 1 3
